  "content": "<h2><strong>MrSwords &amp; Tools 3D 發光版 (OptiFine/Continuity)</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_65ae393f-cabe-4e0b-bf9d-033c16821ffa.png\" alt=\"MrSwords &amp; Tools 3D 發光版\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p><h2><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fMrTuGaaGames\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1349531/description_0805dea8-42b7-44e6-9d8c-641716c7e7b0.png\" alt=\"贊助\" width=\"143\" height=\"36\"></strong></a></h2><h2><strong>您的贊助讓我的付出更有價值，若喜歡此內容請考慮支持我。</strong></h2><p>本高級資源包專為安裝<strong>OptiFine</strong>或<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Continuity</strong></a>的玩家設計，透過自訂3D模型與發光特效全面提升Minecraft中的劍、鎬、斧、鏟及鋤頭視覺效果。此版本完整運用自發光貼圖與著色器友好紋理，在低光源環境中提供更深刻的視覺沉浸感。</p><p>專為追求<strong>極致視覺效果</strong>的玩家打造，本資源包可完美搭配<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mrores-3d-glowing-optifine-continuity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>MrOres 3D 發光版 (OptiFine/Continuity)</strong></a>或<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mrores-3d-vanilla-glowing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MrOres 3D 原版發光</a>&nbsp;</strong>實現工具與礦石統一的發光美學。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1349531/description_6048f1bb-11dd-47a2-ab9e-9581ed38884f.png\" alt=\"鑽石劍\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9905bced-0bf9-4f1a-8bca-3a71dc553c98.png\" alt=\"MrSwords &amp; Tools 3D 發光版\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p><p>🔧 <strong>核心特色：</strong></p><ul>\n<li>\n<p>全系列主要工具與武器的高細節3D模型</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>採用自發光貼圖技術的進階發光紋理</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>完整兼容 OptiFine 與 Continuity</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>著色器友好設計，強化景深與真實感</p>\n</li>\n</ul><p>📸 <strong>使用建議：</strong></p><ul>\n<li>\n<p>最適合開啟著色器的生存、冒險或創造模式世界</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>建議搭配<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mrores-3d-glowing-optifine-continuity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>MrOres 3D 發光版 (OptiFine/Continuity)</strong></a>或<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mrores-3d-vanilla-glowing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MrOres 3D 原版發光</a></strong>&nbsp;達成整體發光風格統一</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>請於OptiFine設定中啟用自發光紋理以獲得完整效果</p>\n</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_f0d9817b-9f4e-4fcf-9b5e-66a1e3f99778.png\" alt=\"MrSwords &amp; Tools 3D 發光版\" width=\"850\" height=\"478\"></p><p>📜 <strong>授權與使用：</strong> 本資源包受自訂授權保護。未經明確許可嚴禁重新分發、修改或商業化使用。完整授權條款包含於下載檔案中。</p>",
